01 LAN Communication
01 局域网通信实验
Objective / 实验目标

Build a simple Local Area Network (LAN) using Cisco Packet Tracer.

使用 Cisco Packet Tracer 搭建一个简单局域网，学习计算机之间如何通过交换机进行通信。

Network Topology / 网络拓扑

Network Structure:

PC0 --------
Switch -------- Server
PC1 --------/

Description:

PC0, PC1 and Server are connected through a Cisco switch to build a simple LAN.

PC0、PC1 和 Server 通过 Cisco 交换机连接，组成一个简单局域网。

Network Devices / 网络设备
PC (Personal Computer)

A PC is used to send and receive network data.

电脑用于发送和接收网络数据。

Switch

A switch connects multiple devices in the same LAN and forwards data between them.

交换机用于连接同一个局域网中的多个设备，并负责数据转发。

Server

A server provides network services for other devices.

服务器为其他设备提供网络服务。

IP Configuration / IP地址配置

Device | IP Address

PC0 | 192.168.1.10

PC1 | 192.168.1.20

Server | 192.168.1.100

Subnet Mask:

255.255.255.0

子网掩码：

255.255.255.0

Connectivity Test / 通信测试

Command:

ping 192.168.1.100

Result:

Reply received from Server.

The network communication is successful.

结果：

PC0 成功收到 Server 回复，说明局域网通信正常。

MAC Address Learning / MAC地址学习

The switch automatically learns MAC addresses from connected devices.

交换机会自动学习连接设备的 MAC 地址。

Command:

show mac address-table

Purpose:

Display MAC addresses and corresponding switch ports.

作用：

查看 MAC 地址和交换机端口之间的对应关系。

Experiment Result / 实验结果

The LAN communication experiment is completed successfully.

实验完成：

PC0 can communicate with Server.
Switch successfully learns MAC addresses.
LAN communication works normally.

实验结果：

PC0 可以与 Server 通信。
交换机成功学习 MAC 地址。
局域网通信正常。
